                <hgroup>
                                        <h4>Morningside Campus Status Updates </h4>
                                                        </hgroup>
                <div class="overall-notification-content">
                    <p><strong>Current Access Level “I” – ID Only</strong>: CUID holders, alumni, and approved guests only</p>
<ul>
<li>Campus open to active affiliate Columbia University ID (CUID) holders and approved guests only.</li>
<li>Columbia students, faculty, and staff can use the <a class="external" href="https://academic.cuit.columbia.edu/guestaccess/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">guest registration portal</a> to register up to two same-day guests. Alumni can use the portal to register for campus same-day access as well. Learn more below.</li>
</ul>
                </div>
