			by <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/anne-sophie-corbeau/">Anne-Sophie Corbeau</a> & <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dr-tatiana-mitrova/">Tatiana Mitrova</a>			<span class="card-date">&#8226; January 26, 2026</span>
            
		</div>

	</div>
    
    
