			by <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dr-luisa-palacios/">Luisa Palacios</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/diego-rivera-rivota/">Diego Rivera Rivota</a> & <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/ira-joseph/">Ira Joseph</a>			<span class="card-date">&#8226; January 21, 2026</span>
            
		</div>

	</div>
    
    
