<article class="type-blog">
	<div class="co-article-content">
        		<div class="card-head">
			<a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/topics/energy-policy/" class="card-head-topic">Energy Policy</a>
		</div>
        		<h4>
			<a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/six-key-issues-that-defined-climate-week-2025/">
				Six Key Issues That Defined Climate Week 2025			</a>
		</h4>
        		<p>CGEP scholars reflect on some of the standout issues of the day during this year's Climate Week</p>
                
		<div class="card-scholars">

            <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/blog" class="card-head-cat">Blog</a>
			by <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dr-erica-downs/">Erica Downs</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dave-turk/">Dave Turk</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/kate-guy/">Kate Guy</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dr-gautam-jain/">Gautam Jain</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/dr-luisa-palacios/">Luisa Palacios</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/david-sandalow/">David Sandalow</a>, <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/vivek-shastry/">Vivek Shastry</a> & <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/jack-andreasen-cavanaugh/">Jack Andreasen Cavanaugh</a>			<span class="card-date">&#8226; October 10, 2025</span>
            
		</div>

	</div>
    
    
    	<figure class="item-figure">
        <a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/six-key-issues-that-defined-climate-week-2025/" class="img-holder">
