        </a>
        	</figure>
		    
        
    

</article>


<article class="type-blog">
	<div class="co-article-content">
        		<div class="card-head">
			<a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/topics/natural-gas/" class="card-head-topic">Natural Gas</a>
		</div>
        		<h4>
			<a href="https://www.energypolicy.columbia.edu/power-of-siberia-2-russias-pivot-chinas-leverage-and-global-gas-implications/">
				Power of Siberia 2: Russia&#8217;s Pivot, China&#8217;s Leverage, and Global Gas Implications			</a>
		</h4>
        		<p>President Putin's trip to China marks a turning point in the trajectory of Russian pipeline gas flows to the country.</p>
                
		<div class="card-scholars">

